c in test\n- Do not include fmpz_mat.h in header\n- Rename transform_kappa -> siegel_kappa\n- Use less macros for ctx_tau\n- Remove macros for exp_tau\n- Add g in ctx_tau, remove macro\n- Remove macros ctx_is_real, ctx_exp_z, ctx_uinv, ctx_u\n- Rename naive_radius->sum_radius\n- Rename jet_ql_bounds -> sum_bound\n- Use new function char_table\n- Add argument ab in char_table\n- Rename transform_char -> char_table\n- Rename transform_proj -> char_shuffle\n- Add flag allow_shift in ctx_tau\n- Restore all tests\n- Avoid some nans","tree":{"sha":"3df93eab7ccb08afbaa9616468c8b98646f8f2d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flintlib/flint/git/trees/3df93eab7ccb08afbaa9616468c8b98646f8f2d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flintlib/flint/git/commits/4ce379a37a35962920248a39b8f2f67aeebedea8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flintlib/flint/commits/4ce379a37a35962920248a39b8f2f67aeebedea8","html_url":"https://github.com/flintlib/flint/commit/4ce379a37a35962920248a39b8f2f67aeebedea8","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flintlib/flint/commits/4ce379a37a35962920248a39b8f2f67aeebedea8/comments","author":{"login":"j-kieffer","id":26251721,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MjUxNzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26251721?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-kieffer","html_url":"https://github.com/j-kieffer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-kieffer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-kieffer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-kieffer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-kieffer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-kieffer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-kieffer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-kieffer/repos","events_url":"ht